      "EN": "We are the advance party of the Monolith faction called \"The Power of the Great Monolith\". I am the guardian of the elements of the sacred Sphere of the Sun, the right hand of Charon himself. We bring death to the infidels and extend the power of the Monolith to the south, standing guard over the tranquility of the Eternal City of Pripyat. Here we carry out the last will of Charon, destroying the infidels.",
      "JA_current": "We are the advance party of the Monolith faction called \"The Power of the Great Monolith\". I am the guardian of the elements of the sacred Sphere of the Sun, the right hand of Charon himself. We bring death to the infidels and extend the power of the Monolith to the south, standing guard over the tranquility of the Eternal City of Pripyat. Here we carry out the last will of Charon, destroying the infidels.",
